        "execSummary":  "The extension of governance frameworks to agentic systems is the decision-relevant headline: as enterprises deploy autonomous agents, Microsoft is signaling it will provide the compliance scaffolding regulators and boards will demand. EU AI Act compliance work is particularly significant for multinational enterprises -- Microsoft is positioning Azure and Copilot as the path of least regulatory resistance. For enterprise procurement and legal teams, this report provides documentation that can support internal AI governance programs and vendor risk assessments. The caveat is that transparency reports are self-published; independent third-party audits of agentic AI behavior remain the gap.",
