        "execSummary":  "Real-time voice AI with built-in reasoning is a direct threat and opportunity for enterprise customer-support operations: the combination of sub-second speech-to-speech latency and function-calling capability means AI can handle voice interactions end-to-end, not just transcribe them for human agents. The 4.0% word error rate across 85+ languages sets a new baseline for multilingual voice support coverage that would have required expensive custom models two years ago. The $0.005/minute pricing is low enough to make AI-handled voice a cost-competitive alternative to offshore agent staffing at significant scale. Enterprises evaluating voice AI deployments should benchmark Gemini 3.8 Live against incumbent vendors, as this release materially shifts the competitive landscape.",
