        "execSummary":  "A native Windows Gemini app is Google\u0027s most direct competitive move against Microsoft Copilot, which ships embedded in Windows 11 and Microsoft 365 -- this puts Gemini one keyboard shortcut away from the same ambient-access position Microsoft has spent three years building. For enterprise IT leaders, this creates a new governance consideration: employees in Google Workspace environments may begin using Gemini for Windows to interact with corporate data outside managed channels. The Gmail and Drive integration accelerates adoption among existing Google Workspace customers, potentially making Gemini the default AI layer for that segment before Microsoft can consolidate its position. Enterprises with mixed Microsoft-Google environments should update their AI acceptable-use policies to address this new access vector.",
